1752 0 obj
  << /ActualText (As a research student at \311TS \050\311cole de Technologie Sup\351rieure\051\054 I worked under the supervision of Fabio Petrillo\054 actively engaging in the exciting field of video game testing using reinforcement learning techniques\056 My main responsibility was to design and implement a comprehensive framework for developers to evaluate and test their games\056\nDesigned and developed a testing software in Python\054 integrating video games and based on the Behavior Driven Development \050BDD\051 method\054 similar to the Cucumber tool\056\nDeveloped and implemented reinforcement learning algorithms\056\nCreated unit tests to ensure the software\047s full functionality\056\nDeveloped video games to test the software in real\055world scenarios\056\nConducted a literature review on reinforcement learning and video game testing\056)
